Package: com.guacforlife.reynarddefault
Name: ReynardDefault
Version: 1.7.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Web links open in Reynard globally; browsers themselves stay launchable (plain launches are restored). Per-app sources configurable via redirect.<bundle id> keys. Inline Settings toggles, no preference bundle; iPadOS 15.x compatible.
